WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.240
Can I build a full-on decentralized exchange faster than it takes to make my smoothie?

00:04.240 --> 00:06.320
I'm sitting here in a cafe and today I'm going to race.

00:06.320 --> 00:07.280
Let's test that theory out.

00:07.280 --> 00:08.880
A tropical bliss please.

00:08.880 --> 00:11.200
I just asked them how long do they think they're going to take.

00:11.200 --> 00:13.600
This is three minutes, so I have three minutes on the clock.

00:23.120 --> 00:25.280
And create our decks.

00:26.800 --> 00:27.120
Bam!

00:27.120 --> 00:29.040
And we finished.

00:29.040 --> 00:30.480
Ah, thank you so much brother.

00:30.480 --> 00:31.200
No problem.

00:31.200 --> 00:32.560
I appreciate it bro.

00:32.560 --> 00:33.200
And there we go.

00:33.200 --> 00:34.640
That theory is busted.

